# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY: this repository is PUBLIC.
#
# HAR captures contain session tokens in request headers and, on emulated
# sessions, investor and internal email addresses in cleartext. They must never
# reach this repo — not in a branch, not in a stash, not "temporarily".
# These two rules exist before any other tooling and should not be relaxed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.har
*.har.gz
*.harx
test/fixtures/
**/test/fixtures/

# Local capture scratch space, in case anyone drops a capture next to the code.
captures/
**/captures/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ordinary build and tooling noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
